OL,5,G2200 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FThis episode looks at how life can
OL,7,     Fchange in the blink of an eye. A
OL,8,     Fwoman fights for her life after a
OL,9,     Fshocking random act of violence.
OL,10,     FAnd Tom, who's 12, has been hit by
OL,11,     Fa car.
OL,12,G2305 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FGrandmother Rose, who's 80, has
OL,14,     Ffluid on her lungs and is having
OL,15,     Ftrouble breathing, and 55-year-old
OL,16,     Ftrucker Kevin has serious injuries
OL,17,     Fafter his lorry rolled down a
OL,18,     Fverge.
